# Code owners for gating files only (m14, workspace#2314). A file listed here
# judges or gates a merge or a deploy, so the owner approves it. Every other
# file is unowned, so an agent PR touching only those merges on the reviewer
# App's approval. There is deliberately no catch-all line. GitHub CODEOWNERS
# matches case-sensitively and has no character classes, so the name forms
# below are the lower-case, Capitalised and UPPER-case spellings.

# CI workflows and actions: they decide pass or fail on every pull request.
/.github/                                      @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/.github/workflows/                          @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/.github/actions/                            @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# CODEOWNERS and ruleset or branch-protection files: they say who must approve.
**/CODEOWNERS                                  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/codeowners                                  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/CodeOwners                                  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*ruleset*                                   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Ruleset*                                   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*RULESET*                                   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*branch-protection*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Branch-Protection*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BRANCH-PROTECTION*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*branch_protection*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Branch_Protection*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BRANCH_PROTECTION*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*branchprotection*                          @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BranchProtection*                          @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BRANCHPROTECTION*                          @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# Lint and merged-status tools every repo's CI calls, the hook registry that
# runs them, and the ignore files that switch checks off.
/tools/                                        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.pre-commit-hooks.yaml                        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.docs-lint*                                   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.opv-lintignore                               @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# Standards gate: the floors, skip rules and mode the standards CI reads.
/.standardsignore                              @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards.mode                               @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/tools/floors.tsv                              @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards-db-tooling                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# Gate scripts at any depth: the merge script reads a scripts directory, or a
# name containing guard, approval or deploy, as a gate.
**/scripts/                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*guard*                                     @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Guard*                                     @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*GUARD*                                     @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*approv*                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Approv*                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*APPROV*                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*deploy*                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Deploy*                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*DEPLOY*                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
